# Fixture zone source for the tzdata test-suite.
#
# Authored for this fork; it is not copied from an upstream tzdata file.  It
# uses its own rule set and abbreviations so that the expected transition
# instants can be derived from this file alone.  See NOTICE.md and
# FORK-NOTES.md for provenance.

# Daylight saving time runs from 02:00 local standard time on the Sunday on
# or after 8 March until 02:00 local daylight time on the Sunday on or after
# 1 November, in 2005 and 2006 only.
Rule	FX	2005	2006	-	Mar	Sun>=8	2:00	1:00	-
Rule	FX	2005	2006	-	Nov	Sun>=1	2:00	0	-

Zone	Etc/Fixture	-5:00	FX	Fxs/Fxd
Zone	Etc/FixtureUTC	0	-	UTC
Link	Etc/FixtureUTC	Etc/FixtureAlias
